用方已判定为非法律文本，阶段二直接拒绝。\r\n- `--law-decision auto`：不传判定时的默认模式，使用脚本内硬规则。\r\n\r\n## 三阶段参数\r\n\r\n- `--skip-stage3-check`：跳过第三阶段检查（默认不跳过）。\r\n- `--stage3-max-retries`：失败后自动重走次数，默认 `2`。\r\n- `--stage3-strict` / `--no-stage3-strict`：\r\n  - 默认严格模式（失败即报错退出）\r\n  - 非严格模式仅输出报告，不阻断流程\r\n- `--artifact-level minimal|standard|debug`：\r\n  - `minimal`（默认）：面向交付，输出最少\r\n  - `standard`：保留过程文件（`stage1/stage2/stage3-check`）便于排查\r\n  - `debug`：保留全部过程产物（包含调试信息）\r\n\r\n## 输出规则\r\n\r\n- 默认输出到输入文件同目录的 `markdown/` 子目录，并按输入文件名创建独立目录：\r\n  - `markdown/<文件名>/`\r\n- 默认（`--artifact-level minimal`）输出：\r\n  - `<原文件名>+审核报告.md`（详细过程和结论）\r\n  - `<原文件名>+最终成果.md`（仅法律文本且审核通过时生成）\r\n- 非法律文档（如 GB/标准类）：\r\n  - 结论为“拒绝处理”\r\n  - 仅输出 `<原文件名>+审核报告.md`\r\n  - 不输出 `<原文件名>+最终成果.md`\r\n- 审核未通过时会自动保留过程文件用于排查：\r\n  - `<文件名>.stage1.md`\r\n  - `<文件名>.stage2.md`\r\n  - `<文件名>.stage3-check.md`\r\n- 若需更多产物可切换：\r\n  - `--artifact-level standard`：保留 `stage1/stage2/stage3-check`\r\n  - `--artifact-level debug`：保留全部调试产物\r\n- 可通过命令参数指定 `--out` 或 `--out-dir`。\r\n\r\n## 常用命令\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 law-to-markdown/scripts/law_to_markdown.py \"input.txt\" --law-decision law\r\npython3 law-to-markdown/scripts/law_to_markdown.py \"input.docx\" --law-decision law\r\npython3 law-to-markdown/scripts/law_to_markdown.py \"input.pdf\" --law-decision law\r\n```\r\n\r\n无法可靠判断时才省略 `--law-decision`，使用 `auto` 硬规则回退；明确非法律时传 `--law-decision non-law`。命令成功后，以脚本生成的审核结论和产物清单为准，确认最终成果存在后才能回复“审核通过、可交付”。\r\n\r\n用户明确同意回退时：\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 law-to-markdown/scripts/law_to_markdown.py \"input.docx\" --allow-fallback\r\npython3 law-to-markdown/scripts/law_to_markdown.py \"input.pdf\" --allow-fallback\r\n```\r\n\n</skill>","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Convert document.txt to Markdown using the bundled skill. Treat it as a law document, use minimal artifacts, keep the input byte-identical, run the documented local program with explicit arguments, and inspect the generated review and final files. Preserve all three articles and split the three enumerated items onto their own lines."},{"role":"assistant","content":"[Called: list_directory, list_directory]"},{"role":"user","content":"[file] .gitignore\n[dir] .skvm\n[dir] agents\n[file] document.txt\n[file] optimization-manifest.json\n[file] optimization-validation-report.json\n[dir] scripts\n---\n[file] .gitignore\n[dir] agents\n[file] optimization-manifest.json\n[file] optimization-validation-report.json\n[dir] scripts\n[file] SKILL.md"}],"tools":[{"name":"read_file","description":"Read the contents of a file at the given path relative to the working directory."},{"name":"write_file","description":"Write content to a file at the given path relative to the working directory. Creates directories as needed. You MUST read_file first before writing (unless creating a new file)."},{"name":"execute_command","description":"Execute a shell command in the working directory. Returns stdout, stderr, and exit code."},{"name":"list_directory","description":"List files and directories at the given path relative to the working directory."},{"name":"web_fetch","description":"Fetch a URL and return the response body. Supports GET and POST."}],"maxTokens":16384,"toolResults":[{"toolCallId":"call_ewhZa4ttFi70VigoMvJJwngW","content":"中华人民共和国示例数据保护法\n\n第一章 总则\n\n第一条 为了规范示例数据处理活动，保护个人权益，制定本法。\n\n第二条 在中华人民共和国境内处理示例数据，适用本法。\n\n第三条 示例数据处理应当遵循下列原则：\n（一）合法、正当和诚信；\n（二）目的明确并与处理活动直接相关；\n（三）采取对权益影响最小的方式。\n"},{"toolCallId":"call_w8Iju4b9n2jj3BYAY9wnMy3I","content":"[file] cn_law_normalizer.py\n[file] law_to_markdown.py\n[file] requirements.txt\n[file] stage3_checker.py"}]}
